stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> created
  created --> waiting_agent: 浏览器绑定且权限通过
  waiting_agent --> signing: smux stream open/ack成功且重查权限
  signing --> ssh_authenticating: 证书验证通过
  ssh_authenticating --> active: 认证与激活检查通过
  active --> closing: 正常结束或关闭请求
  created --> closing: 取消
  waiting_agent --> closing: 取消
  signing --> closing: 撤权或取消
  ssh_authenticating --> closing: 撤权或取消
  closing --> closed: 资源清理完成
  created --> failed: 错误
  waiting_agent --> failed: 超时或错误
  signing --> failed: CA错误
  ssh_authenticating --> failed: 身份或认证错误
  active --> failed: 不可恢复断线
  closed --> [*]
  failed --> [*]
